    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已矣乎<sup>a</sup> ！寓形宇内复几时<sup>b</sup> ？曷不委心任去留<sup>c</sup> ？胡为乎 遑遑欲何之<sup>d</sup> ？富贵非吾愿，帝乡不可期<sup>e</sup>。怀良辰以孤往<sup>f</sup>，或 植杖而耘耔<sup>g</sup>。登东皋以舒啸<sup>h</sup>，临清流而赋诗。聊乘化以归尽<sup>i</sup>， 乐夫天命复奚疑 <sup>j</sup> ！",
        "bbox": [
            105,
            67,
            702,
            156
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/b582b917bd62f075163102bb2e67871213116a6ff3cc9db1cb09a0754446b07d.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [
            "临清流而赋诗图  ［明］李在 作"
        ],
        "bbox": [
            110,
            193,
            899,
            406
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/c98c46df5a75f25c3938a6f2282d840d75636724ff0759d09be8b394581e1e50.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "bbox": [
            131,
